{"4672370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DATAWANDER", "steam_appid": 4672370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DATAWANDER is a walking simulator where you wander through a mysterious digital space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no clear objectives such as combat or goals; only the act of walking. Explore a resort-like map, discovering the reactions of action buttons, hidden paths, and fantastical moments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also small mini-games scattered throughout. Explore the virtual world in your free time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Quiet and fantastical digital space </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Minimalist exploration experience </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple mini-games for relaxation </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A game you can enjoy in short bursts </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD or arrow keys: Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Camera movement </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Ctrl: Action</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DATAWANDER is a walking simulator where you wander through a mysterious digital space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no clear objectives such as combat or goals; only the act of walking. Explore a resort-like map, discovering the reactions of action buttons, hidden paths, and fantastical moments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also small mini-games scattered throughout. Explore the virtual world in your free time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Quiet and fantastical digital space </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Minimalist exploration experience </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple mini-games for relaxation </p><p class=\"bb_paragr